===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|physics}} A [[liquid]] that is the product of [[condensation]] of a [[gas]], i.e. of [[steam]].
# {{lb|en|chemistry}} The product of a [[condensation reaction]].
# {{lb|en|physics}} Any of various condensed [[quantum]] states.

